```bash
{"custom_id": "0", "body": {"max_tokens": 128, "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "What is the best French cheese?"}]}}
{"custom_id": "1", "body": {"max_tokens": 512, "temperature": 0.2, "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "What is the best French wine?"}]}}
